{"3200030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cobalt System", "steam_appid": 3200030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.poster.avif?t=1764956320\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.webm?t=1764956320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.mp4?t=1764956320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cobalt System is a first-person shooter game that allows you to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of ancient Mars. Playing as a guardian of an abandoned temple complex, fight your way through many obstacles and enemies of different types in order to obtain a lost relic that can change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels and find secret locations as well as various ancient artifacts that will give more understanding about the Martian civilization, which is on the verge of collapse.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.poster.avif?t=1764956320\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.webm?t=1764956320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.mp4?t=1764956320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cobalt System is a first-person shooter game that allows you to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of ancient Mars. Playing as a guardian of an abandoned temple complex, fight your way through many obstacles and enemies of different types in order to obtain a lost relic that can change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels and find secret locations as well as various ancient artifacts that will give more understanding about the Martian civilization, which is on the verge of collapse.</p>", "short_description": "Cobalt System is an atmospheric sci-fi first-person shooter that places you into the heart of the conflict unfolding on ancient Mars.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/header.jpg?t=1764956320", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/b66756fc703dfb469abf68ddb52855f15f7ea869/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764956320", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/b66756fc703dfb469abf68ddb52855f15f7ea869/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764956320", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 4160/AMD FX 8320 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050/AMD RX 470 or better</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770/AMD FX-8350 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>G